          "id": 1303852337,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "You make a good point about the logic around it. My latest revision borrows from the HTTP dissector and instead adds a `smpp.request` field if the flag indicates it's a command/request, or a `smpp.response` field otherwise. (The HTTP field is hidden, but I've opted to keep this one visible, but marked as generated.)",
